 "headHtml": "<!-- QBS-SCHEMA:START -->\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@graph\":[{\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"@id\":\"https://www.praxerasupplements.com/alp/ads-contract-mfg#faq\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What's the difference between private label and contract manufacturing?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Private label uses our existing formulations with your brand on the label. Contract manufacturing typically refers to producing to your specifications (your formulation, your packaging, your everything). We do both. Most clients start with private label and add contract manufacturing as they grow.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How long do contract manufacturing projects typically take?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"12 to 16 weeks from project kickoff to first production run. The timeline includes formulation development, ingredient sourcing, stability testing, manufacturing scale-up, and first batch production. Faster is possible for simpler formulations.\"}}]}]}</script>\n<!-- QBS-SCHEMA:END -->",
